        "name": "Learning Center & Outdoor Classroom",
        "category": "building",
        "info": "Originally a dog kennel for the Guggenheims, today the Learning Center is home to programs and activities for children of all ages. In 2011, the Outdoor Classroom was created, and the space was dedicated as the Phil Dejana Learning Center. The Outdoor Classroom is designed to foster a love of nature through exploration and play.",
