    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Ice House Lounge",
        "category": "building",
        "info": "The walls of our Ice House Lounge are remnants of a storage space built in the 1950s by the U.S. Navy when they inhabited our grounds. By clearing debris, landscaping the surrounding area, and adding outdoor furniture and a tension sail roof, this space has been rehabilitated and repurposed as an outdoor lounge for visitors to relax in and enjoy. Visit \u003Ca href=\"https://www.sandspointpreserveconservancy.org/news/pond-revitalization-project/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003EPond Revitalization Project\u003C/a\u003E for more information.",
